## 4. Restrictions and Prohibited Uses

Except with **prior written permission** signed or issued by an authorized
representative of the Copyright Holder, You must **NOT**:

1. **Redistribute Original or Modified Source Code:** Copy, mirror, repackage,
   publish, upload, or redistribute the Covered Work (in whole or in
   substantial part), or any modified version of the Covered Work, through public
   or private channels other than standard repository inspection permitted on
   the official hosting platform without distributing derivative artifacts.
2. **Distribute Unofficial or Modified Binaries:** Publish, distribute,
   sublicense, host, sideload-distribute, or upload compiled installers, APKs,
   packages, executables, or containers built from original or modified Covered
   Work across Windows, Linux, macOS, Android, app stores, or third-party
   download portals.
3. **Commercial Exploitation:** Sell, license, sublicense, rent, lease,
   monetize, bundle with paid/ad-supported products, or use the Covered Work (or
   any substantially derived software incorporating protected code from the
   Covered Work) to deliver a commercial product or paid hosted service.
4. **Substantially Derived Products:** Create and distribute standalone
   applications, forks, forks-as-a-product, SDKs, or derivative software
   substantially derived from or incorporating protected RtMaga source code,
   architecture-specific original modules, or UI components without prior
   written authorization.
5. **Rebranding and Misrepresentation of Origin:** Remove, alter, obscure, or
   replace copyright notices, `LICENSE`, `COPYRIGHT.md`, `NOTICE`, or
   attribution; rename or rebrand the Covered Work as another product for
   distribution; or distribute any build in a way that implies official
   endorsement, sponsorship, or origin from RtMaga.

